# Keep the build context small and force a clean install inside the image.
.git
.github
node_modules
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
.nx
.yarn/cache
.yarn/install-state.gz
pnpm-lock.yaml
*.log
.env
**/.env
# Next.js reads .env.local during `next build`. A developer's local file (local auth mode, local
# API URL, local Cognito ids) must never be baked into an image — the image takes its
# NEXT_PUBLIC_* values from build args only (apps/web/Dockerfile).
**/.env.local
**/.env.*.local
docs
infra
infra-aws
design
coverage
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
